{% block content %}{% raw %}
<section class="page-hero has-img" data-screen-label="Cartes cadeaux — hero">
  <div class="ph-bg" data-parallax="0.1"><img fetchpriority="high" sizes="100vw" src="/images/IMG_2016.jpg" alt="Sunset over a beach in Thailand"></div>
  <div class="ph-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Travel Gift Cards</p>
    <h1>Give a Trip, Not Just a Destination</h1>
    <p>Birthday, wedding, Christmas, a group gift… Giving a trip means giving time, experiences and memories that never fade.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad">
  <div class="container narrow text-center">
    <p class="lead" data-reveal>A Zwald gift card is a complete travel service to give: I create a tailor-made itinerary for the person of your choice, based on their wishes, pace and budget. All they have to do is enjoy it.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow center">What's included</p>
      <h2>Much more than just a card</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid cols-3">
      <div class="card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3l2 5 5 .5-3.8 3.3L16 17l-4-2.6L8 17l.8-5.2L5 8.5 10 8z"/></svg></span><h3>Tailor-made trip</h3><p>An itinerary created around the pace, wishes and budget of the person you're giving it to.</p></div>
      <div class="card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 5a2 2 0 012-2h9l5 5v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg></span><h3>Travel journal</h3><p>Flights, accommodation, day-by-day activities, local contacts, checklists and practical tips.</p></div>
      <div class="card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 01-9 8.5 8.4 8.4 0 01-4.4-1.2L3 20l1.3-5A8.4 8.4 0 0112 3a8.5 8.5 0 019 8.5z"/></svg></span><h3>Personal support</h3><p>Responsive support before and during the trip. Bookings remain the traveler's responsibility.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow center">100% customizable</p>
      <h2>You choose everything</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="info-grid">
      <div class="info-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"><div class="k">Amount</div><div class="v">Choose your amount — <span class="price-chf" data-chf="50">50 CHF</span>, <span class="price-chf" data-chf="100">100 CHF</span> or <span class="price-chf" data-chf="200">200 CHF</span>… or more</div></div>
      <div class="info-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><div class="k">Recipient</div><div class="v">The recipient's first name on the card</div></div>
      <div class="info-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3"><div class="k">Destination</div><div class="v">Specific, or left open to discover</div></div>
      <div class="info-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"><div class="k">Occasion</div><div class="v">Christmas, birthday, wedding, farewell…</div></div>
      <div class="info-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><div class="k">Message</div><div class="v">A personalized note included</div></div>
      <div class="info-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3"><div class="k">Format</div><div class="v">PDF or image, ready to give</div></div>
    </div>
    <span class="currency-note" hidden>Indicative rate, updated daily — CHF remains the reference currency.</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow center">Why give it</p>
      <h2>The gift that truly delights</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid cols-3">
      <div class="card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"><h3>Zero stress</h3><p>You're giving a fully organized trip: no hassle, just enjoyment.</p></div>
      <div class="card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><h3>Real savings</h3><p>Thanks to my local rates, the recipient travels at fair prices, far from tourist traps.</p></div>
      <div class="card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3"><h3>Lasting memories</h3><p>A gift that's experienced and retold long after — much more than an object.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-teal section-pad">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow center on-dark" data-reveal style="justify-content:center;color:#fff;margin-bottom:18px">Ready to give?</p>
    <h2 data-reveal style="font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,3.6rem)">Order Your Gift Card</h2>
    <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);max-width:60ch;margin:18px auto 32px;font-size:1.1rem">Tell me the occasion, the amount and who it's for — I'll prepare a personalized card, ready to give.</p>
    <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><a class="btn btn-white btn-lg" href="/en/contact/" data-magnetic><span>Order my gift card <svg class="arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
